# TARGET ARCHITECTURE: x86_64 | v0.19 | aws/almalinux9
# Enterprise Linux Audit v0.19  |  [aws/almalinux9]
# Tier: tier-1-baseline
# Purpose: initialize managed policy
# Source/authority: linux-audit/audit-userspace rules/10-base-config.rules; enterprise policy
# Architecture: x86_64 (b64 native, b32 compatibility); use aarch64/ subprofile for ARM64.
# Release state: engineering candidate; NOT independently certified STIG compliant.


# NOTE: fail-secure -f 2 is configured in tier-1-baseline/18-security-critical.rules;
# review both files together. This foundation file does not set the failure mode.
# WARNING: -D clears existing kernel audit rules. Merge into site policy only with change approval.
-D
-b 8192
--backlog_wait_time 60000
